WEBVTT

00:00:04.010 --> 00:00:05.620
Where are you going?

00:00:05.620 --> 00:00:07.050
What do you care?

00:00:07.050 --> 00:00:10.880
Are this man and Sayaka Nakasugi together?

00:00:12.290 --> 00:00:14.990
I don't know.

00:00:14.990 --> 00:00:18.330
You're a poor liar.

00:00:18.330 --> 00:00:20.800
Nakasugi is not the Ryunka!

00:00:20.800 --> 00:00:24.230
If that's what you think,
then stay here and sit tight.

00:00:24.230 --> 00:00:26.570
You can't do anything.

00:00:26.570 --> 00:00:31.200
Because if you set foot away from home,
it'll be leading me to her.

00:02:12.070 --> 00:02:14.840
Are you ready?

00:02:14.840 --> 00:02:17.280
Then let's get the ball rolling.

00:02:25.460 --> 00:02:28.080
Where are you, Birdy?

00:02:29.490 --> 00:02:31.590
Birdy Cephon Altira is currently...

00:02:31.590 --> 00:02:35.970
- either out of range or
has powered off their phone.

00:02:35.970 --> 00:02:36.770
Please call back later.

00:02:36.770 --> 00:02:37.960
"Sayaka Nakasugi"

00:02:37.960 --> 00:02:38.590
Please call back later.

00:02:45.040 --> 00:02:48.480
This was the right decision, wasn't it?

00:02:48.480 --> 00:02:50.470
I'm sure it was right.

00:02:53.880 --> 00:02:58.550
But we can't make a special
broadcast now! It's too sudden!

00:02:58.550 --> 00:03:03.790
It's what our corporate partner wants.

00:03:03.790 --> 00:03:05.330
Mr. Shyamalan?

00:03:05.330 --> 00:03:06.730
That's right.

00:03:27.480 --> 00:03:29.220
That dress suits you.

00:03:29.220 --> 00:03:30.650
Thank you.

00:03:36.160 --> 00:03:39.000
Is this alcohol?

00:03:39.000 --> 00:03:43.030
Me, serve alcohol to someone underage?

00:03:43.030 --> 00:03:44.230
Never.

00:03:51.240 --> 00:03:53.440
"Pochi" "Tsutomu" "Koro"

00:03:53.440 --> 00:03:53.740
"A Satisfying Hit"
"Tsutomu sustained 184 points' damage."

00:04:03.920 --> 00:04:08.910
<i>If you set foot away from home,</i>
<i>it'll be leading me to her.</i>

00:04:19.770 --> 00:04:21.960
Never alcohol.

00:04:58.910 --> 00:05:02.110
The bride and groom make their entrance, eh?

00:05:07.520 --> 00:05:11.090
This can only be termed sloppiness.

00:05:11.090 --> 00:05:14.490
We might as well have put
up a sign saying "Steal this."

00:05:14.490 --> 00:05:16.480
Perhaps so.

00:05:18.290 --> 00:05:22.200
The military weren't the only
ones who wanted to know

00:05:22.200 --> 00:05:24.630
the forbidden weapon's power.

00:05:25.970 --> 00:05:28.160
What are you trying to say?

00:05:30.110 --> 00:05:33.640
If someone allowed others to steal
the Ryunka and experiment with it,

00:05:33.640 --> 00:05:36.210
he could avoid the brunt of the blame.

00:05:36.210 --> 00:05:39.350
To do the experiments would be treason,

00:05:39.350 --> 00:05:42.720
but lax security is just a mistake.

00:05:42.720 --> 00:05:44.820
Do you have proof?

00:05:44.820 --> 00:05:49.060
That statement could get you in
trouble in certain circumstances.

00:05:49.060 --> 00:05:53.130
I'm merely mentioning a possibility.

00:05:53.130 --> 00:05:54.360
But...

00:05:54.360 --> 00:05:57.670
If someone who didn't mind
causing a tragedy on a primitive planet

00:05:57.670 --> 00:05:59.900
got ahold of the Ryunka...

00:05:59.900 --> 00:06:02.530
But how would they control it?

00:06:06.810 --> 00:06:09.710
Are you confident you can control it?

00:06:09.710 --> 00:06:13.220
Of course. The Ryunka possesses people.

00:06:13.220 --> 00:06:14.820
That's in order to clearly distinguish

00:06:14.820 --> 00:06:18.190
the chosen ones from those
who should be weeded out.

00:06:18.190 --> 00:06:22.260
The matured Ryunka will
learn the essence of we chosen,

00:06:22.260 --> 00:06:25.860
and bring ruin to the useless barbarians.

00:06:25.860 --> 00:06:28.430
When you make a mistake in piano lessons,

00:06:28.430 --> 00:06:31.530
if you deliberately practice that mistaken phrase,

00:06:31.530 --> 00:06:33.600
it allows you to master the correct fingering.

00:06:33.600 --> 00:06:37.510
If we teach the Ryunka what's
human and what's similar but different,

00:06:37.510 --> 00:06:41.180
it will be able to more
cleverly mow down the fools.

00:06:41.180 --> 00:06:45.510
This Adjuvant System will teach that to her.

00:06:45.510 --> 00:06:48.350
You look like you're having fun.

00:06:48.350 --> 00:06:53.750
I haven't been so excited since
I was given a soccer ball as a kid.

00:06:57.130 --> 00:06:59.400
It's going well.

00:06:59.400 --> 00:07:01.390
It's all going according to plan.

00:07:06.200 --> 00:07:06.940
"Special Broadcast"
"Message from PMI CEO Satyajit Shyamalan"

00:07:06.940 --> 00:07:09.270
We interrupt your regularly-scheduled program

00:07:09.270 --> 00:07:13.210
to bring you a special message

00:07:13.210 --> 00:07:16.710
from Playmaker Industrial
Company CEO Satyajit Shyamalan.

00:07:16.710 --> 00:07:20.110
There will be no commercial interruptions.

00:08:17.710 --> 00:08:19.140
Ryunka...

00:08:22.180 --> 00:08:26.120
It's beautiful... So beautiful!

00:08:26.120 --> 00:08:32.790
The history of life on Earth
has been fraught with extinctions.

00:08:32.790 --> 00:08:39.460
We humans exist as the victors
of five billion years of evolution.

00:08:39.460 --> 00:08:45.900
Now the time has come to be even
more selective about the winners.

00:08:45.900 --> 00:08:47.570
- You are about to witness the
start of a new chapter in history.

00:08:47.570 --> 00:08:50.200
- I knew it.

00:08:51.370 --> 00:08:56.000
That is, <i>if</i> you are one of the chosen ones.

00:09:17.100 --> 00:09:23.870
I'm about to go... dispose of the Ryunka.

00:09:23.870 --> 00:09:28.880
She's on Shyamalan's boat, isn't she?

00:09:28.880 --> 00:09:32.620
Why would you go out of
your way to come tell me that?

00:09:32.620 --> 00:09:35.080
If you're going to go, you can just go.

00:09:35.080 --> 00:09:41.090
Go and "dispose," or kill, or whatever you want.

00:09:41.090 --> 00:09:43.430
Tsutomu, Nakasugi is really...

00:09:43.430 --> 00:09:45.260
Get out!

00:09:46.760 --> 00:09:49.390
Never come back here again.

00:10:26.100 --> 00:10:27.730
Display the location!

00:10:28.500 --> 00:10:32.340
Impure energy is filling the land.

00:10:50.130 --> 00:10:53.030
Even after mankind's triumph,

00:10:53.030 --> 00:10:57.030
we have continued selecting among ourselves.

00:10:57.030 --> 00:10:59.440
We have warred against each other,

00:10:59.440 --> 00:11:04.970
and the survivors have reigned as the chosen ones.

00:11:04.970 --> 00:11:07.140
- Our "wars" have been, to put it another way,
- Where is it? Where is it?!

00:11:07.140 --> 00:11:08.280
- great ceremonies to separate
the good from the bad.
- Dammit!

00:11:08.280 --> 00:11:11.480
- great ceremonies to separate
the good from the bad.

00:11:11.480 --> 00:11:15.470
- War is by no means something to be detested.
- Found it! <i>The Lost Bird!</i>

00:11:35.200 --> 00:11:37.970
Goodbye, Shyamalan.

00:11:37.970 --> 00:11:39.960
And the other one...

00:11:45.250 --> 00:11:47.240
It's stronger than I expected!

00:11:53.060 --> 00:11:56.260
Even the occasional disaster

00:11:56.260 --> 00:12:00.100
has selected the best parts of humanity.

00:12:00.100 --> 00:12:02.100
The plagues of the Middle Ages,

00:12:02.100 --> 00:12:05.730
the Spanish Flu at the dawn of the 20th century...

00:12:05.730 --> 00:12:11.870
Perhaps epidemics were seen
as hellish calamities at the time,

00:12:11.870 --> 00:12:17.580
but in reality, they were
practically the grace of God.

00:12:17.580 --> 00:12:27.560
Because these epidemics wiped out
the weak... the bad parts of humanity.

00:12:27.560 --> 00:12:33.100
However, until now there's been a
huge flaw in our selection processes.

00:12:33.100 --> 00:12:41.240
The bar was set too low, so the bad
were not completely stamped out.

00:12:41.240 --> 00:12:47.480
What we need in the 21st
century is a further <i>winnowing:</i>

00:12:47.480 --> 00:12:52.750
a major surgery that will
completely remove the bad parts.

00:12:52.750 --> 00:12:57.990
We'll cut and cut until the bad parts
are gone, like removing a tumor,

00:12:57.990 --> 00:12:59.990
and eradicate them completely.

00:12:59.990 --> 00:13:02.420
What is he planning to do?

00:13:04.290 --> 00:13:06.630
- Yes?
- Sanada?

00:13:06.630 --> 00:13:08.100
Muroto?!

00:13:08.100 --> 00:13:12.100
Sanada, make sure you
document what's about to happen.

00:13:12.100 --> 00:13:13.970
What's going on?

00:13:13.970 --> 00:13:18.440
Shyamalan... just wants people to die.

00:13:18.440 --> 00:13:21.580
He's sure that <i>he'll</i> survive.

00:13:21.580 --> 00:13:25.410
He's trying to embody the conceit,
hatred, and loneliness everyone has

00:13:25.410 --> 00:13:28.480
in the worst possible way!

00:13:28.480 --> 00:13:30.290
Genocide?

00:13:30.290 --> 00:13:31.790
But how?!

00:13:31.790 --> 00:13:34.990
I don't know... but he plans to do it here in Tokyo.

00:13:34.990 --> 00:13:38.490
That's why you have to record
it and tell everyone about it.

00:13:38.490 --> 00:13:40.430
Can we stop this genocide?

00:13:40.430 --> 00:13:43.530
Probably not. That's reality, right?

00:13:43.530 --> 00:13:44.830
But!

00:13:44.830 --> 00:13:48.270
But we <i>can</i> do something,

00:13:48.270 --> 00:13:51.210
and that's to document everything
that happens and pass it down...

00:13:51.210 --> 00:13:53.640
So mankind won't repeat this mistake.

00:14:23.670 --> 00:14:26.070
Damn! There's no way we could handle that!

00:14:26.070 --> 00:14:29.510
Technology we can't control
might as well be a natural disaster!

00:14:29.510 --> 00:14:32.480
Was siding with Colonel Gatol a mistake?

00:14:32.480 --> 00:14:35.680
I can't believe I failed...
But I sure as hell won't die here!

00:14:35.680 --> 00:14:40.590
Analysis complete.
99.99% match with existing data.

00:14:40.590 --> 00:14:43.360
Life form determined to be the Ryunka.

00:14:43.360 --> 00:14:45.390
We'll begin suppression of the Ryunka.

00:14:45.390 --> 00:14:47.700
Activate the Hydrogenous System.

00:14:47.700 --> 00:14:50.100
Activating Hydrogenous System.

00:14:51.100 --> 00:14:58.340
Facts about the strange phenomena along
the coast of Tokyo Bay today are still unclear.

00:14:58.340 --> 00:15:06.920
From witness accounts, the first
incident happened around 6:00...

00:15:06.920 --> 00:15:10.550
I'm sorry! You're Senkawa, right?

00:15:10.550 --> 00:15:14.520
But you're lucky to have a sibling.

00:15:14.520 --> 00:15:16.920
I'm an only child, so...

00:15:28.270 --> 00:15:29.740
Take a look.

00:15:29.740 --> 00:15:31.730
Just try it.

00:15:32.940 --> 00:15:36.580
Well, you know I've been
sickly since I was little, right?

00:15:36.580 --> 00:15:39.280
So I just naturally came
to like looking at the stars.

00:15:39.280 --> 00:15:40.270
Huh.

00:15:42.820 --> 00:15:46.720
Sorry, Senkawa. Were you waiting long?

00:15:46.720 --> 00:15:50.430
Everyone involved in the
government is keeping mum on the topic.

00:15:50.430 --> 00:15:53.730
Some say the incidents are connected with...

00:15:53.730 --> 00:15:55.560
Thanks for waiting.

00:15:58.130 --> 00:15:59.960
Oh, no!

00:16:05.940 --> 00:16:07.930
I want to go to <i>all</i> the places!

00:16:13.320 --> 00:16:14.510
The Ferris wheel?

00:16:21.260 --> 00:16:25.190
You know what? I died.

00:16:25.190 --> 00:16:29.260
God gave me a new life. I'm a new me.

00:16:29.260 --> 00:16:32.330
I'm sure I was reborn.

00:16:32.330 --> 00:16:33.530
Come on, run!

00:16:35.870 --> 00:16:38.500
I... like that about you.

00:16:49.220 --> 00:16:53.320
I'll be in touch, okay Senkawa?
We'll see each other again, right?

00:16:53.320 --> 00:16:55.690
And the press is being restricted...

00:16:55.690 --> 00:16:58.060
Oh, I'm told we've been able to
contact a reporter near the scene.

00:16:58.060 --> 00:16:59.900
Let's give him a call.

00:16:59.900 --> 00:17:05.200
We shouldn't waste our scientific
power on relief for the weak.

00:17:05.200 --> 00:17:11.040
Its proper use is selecting the strong...
the good part of humanity.

00:17:11.040 --> 00:17:12.230
Sorry!

00:17:17.710 --> 00:17:20.220
As a member of the human race,

00:17:20.220 --> 00:17:24.210
I am deeply glad that I can announce this to you.

00:17:30.230 --> 00:17:34.060
The time for the great selection is upon us.

00:17:50.850 --> 00:17:51.850
Look...

00:17:51.850 --> 00:17:53.580
What is it?

00:17:53.580 --> 00:17:55.750
The birds aren't being attacked anymore.

00:17:55.750 --> 00:17:59.790
It's starting to choose its
targets with more precision.

00:17:59.790 --> 00:18:01.960
This is the second phase of its development.

00:18:01.960 --> 00:18:04.890
From now on, only humans will be killed.

00:18:04.890 --> 00:18:07.460
Hydrogenous System activation complete.

00:18:07.460 --> 00:18:10.070
System is fully charged.

00:18:10.070 --> 00:18:11.460
Fire.

00:18:41.460 --> 00:18:45.930
Suppression failed. The target's
energy level is rapidly increasing.

00:18:45.930 --> 00:18:48.470
It's developing faster than we expected.

00:18:48.470 --> 00:18:50.110
A dangerous state.

00:18:50.110 --> 00:18:53.180
We'll change plans.
Prepare for the purification rites.

00:18:53.180 --> 00:18:54.510
Roger.

00:18:54.510 --> 00:18:59.110
I will now summon the Astral
Ergon for the purification rites.

00:18:59.110 --> 00:19:02.020
We'll carry out the purification
at 1000 times standard level.

00:19:02.020 --> 00:19:06.090
1000 times? Are we allowed to do that?

00:19:06.090 --> 00:19:09.520
Service has been suspended for all JR lines.

00:19:09.520 --> 00:19:12.520
We have no estimate of when it will resume.

00:19:15.200 --> 00:19:16.600
What is this?

00:19:16.600 --> 00:19:17.590
Huh?

00:19:22.170 --> 00:19:24.600
Where are we?

00:19:35.480 --> 00:19:36.950
An earthquake?

00:19:36.950 --> 00:19:39.790
No. Something's off.

00:19:44.360 --> 00:19:48.660
Nechla, please wait!

00:19:48.660 --> 00:19:52.060
You have one hour before
the purification rites start.

00:19:56.040 --> 00:19:58.030
<i>Do something before then.</i>

00:19:59.310 --> 00:20:02.140
5.6% charged.

00:20:29.700 --> 00:20:31.240
Senkawa!

00:20:31.240 --> 00:20:32.670
Mr. Muroto?

00:20:32.670 --> 00:20:34.070
Where are you haring off to?!

00:20:37.080 --> 00:20:38.410
Is it her?

00:20:38.410 --> 00:20:39.210
Huh?

00:20:39.210 --> 00:20:43.220
We're up against Sayaka Nakasugi, am I right?

00:20:43.220 --> 00:20:45.210
- Yes.
- Do you love her?

00:20:46.890 --> 00:20:48.220
Yes.

00:20:48.220 --> 00:20:51.220
You're an honest guy. I'm jealous.

00:20:55.060 --> 00:20:57.370
Jerk!

00:20:57.370 --> 00:20:59.870
All right, you're on your own from here.

00:20:59.870 --> 00:21:01.060
Okay!

00:21:03.970 --> 00:21:06.810
Must be nice to be young!

00:21:09.110 --> 00:21:11.110
What the hell are you doing?!

00:21:11.110 --> 00:21:16.740
I guess it's been around two weeks
since I was accused of obstruction...

00:21:42.280 --> 00:21:43.810
<i>Let's go! Have a good time!</i>

00:22:28.890 --> 00:22:33.130
<i>C'mon baby, c'mon baby, everybody yeah yeah</i>

00:22:33.130 --> 00:22:34.830
<i>Let's go! Have a new time!</i>

00:22:34.830 --> 00:22:37.670
<i>Everybody all de best na good smile</i>

00:22:37.670 --> 00:22:41.640
<i>Happy smile, ima subete hitotsu ni naru</i>

00:22:41.640 --> 00:22:43.240
<i>Let's go! Have a new world!</i>

00:22:43.240 --> 00:22:46.510
<i>Don't worry tsunaida sono te wa hanasanai</i>

00:22:46.510 --> 00:22:50.310
<i>Kitto kimi no asu no chikara ni naru</i>

00:22:50.310 --> 00:22:51.750
<i>Let's go! Have a good time!</i>

00:22:51.750 --> 00:22:54.880
<i>Everybody peace de chiiku na happy time</i>

00:22:54.880 --> 00:22:58.890
<i>Put your hands, ima hitotsu ni narou ze</i>

00:22:58.890 --> 00:23:00.220
<i>Let's go! Have a good time!</i>

00:23:00.220 --> 00:23:03.690
<i>Everybody peace de chiiku na happy time</i>

00:23:03.690 --> 00:23:09.320
<i>Put your hands, ima hitotsu ni narou ze</i>

00:23:11.700 --> 00:23:14.770
<i>Shion Arita here, yessiree!</i>

00:23:14.770 --> 00:23:18.770
<i>Yay! Woo! It's the last episode, Sirs!</i>

00:23:18.770 --> 00:23:22.840
<i>Nakasugi up and turned into the Ryunka!</i>

00:23:22.840 --> 00:23:28.080
<i>But Tsutomu won't give up, nosiree!</i>
<i>And neither will Birdy!</i>

00:23:28.080 --> 00:23:32.690
<i>Can their love bring about a happy ending?!</i>

00:23:32.690 --> 00:23:39.530
<i>Wah, I can't see the end</i>
<i>credits through my tears!</i>
